cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research harness or its experimental methodology, please cite this repository."
title: "Pokémon Red AI: Discovery Without Durable Competence"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Andrews
    given-names: Peter
repository-code: "https://github.com/PeteAndrews1289/pokemon-red-ai"
url: "https://github.com/PeteAndrews1289/pokemon-red-ai"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-07-28
abstract: >-
  A completed, reproducible study of whether one randomly initialized recurrent visual policy
  could turn self-generated Pokémon Red experience into durable cumulative skills. The final V12
  run processed 8.24 million actions and replay-verified seven discoveries through Route 1, but
  frozen evaluation ended at 55/502 with zero competent skills and no composition.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - continual learning
  - recurrent PPO
  - game AI
  - reproducible research
  - negative results
